msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Are you kidding?  That was the best!  When I imagine the face of that "
"arrogant cook… mmm, sweet, sweet picture.  Oh, and how we beat up that "
"<freaking> food-<name_b>, I dreamed about it for so long… and my restaurant, "
"we beat the shit out of those <name_b>s.  Too bad it was trashed as hell… "
"anyway, let's hit the dirt."
msgstr ""

