#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_3.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"The morgue.  Seems like a dumb place to go at the start of a zombie "
"apocalypse, right?  Thing is, nobody had made it to the morgue in quite a "
"while, the bodies were reanimating too quickly and the staff were just too "
"busy.  I was shaking and puking and I could see the world was ending… I "
"bundled myself up, grabbed a few snacks from the pathologist's desk, and "
"crawled into one of those drawers to contemplate the end of the world.  After"
" breaking the handle to make sure it couldn't lock behind me, of course.  It "
"was safe and quiet in there.  Not just my cubby, the whole morgue.  At first "
"it was because nobody was dumb enough to come down there except me.  Later, "
"it was because nobody was left."
msgstr ""

